    "htmlUrl": "https://github.com/AppFlowy-IO/AppFlowy/blob/main/README.md",
    "excerpt": "<h1 align=\"center\" style=\"border-bottom: none\">\n    <b><a href=\"https://www.appflowy.com\">AppFlowy</a></b><br>\n    ⭐️ The Open Source Alternative To Notion ⭐️\n</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\nAppFlowy is the AI workspace where you achieve more without losing control of your data.\n</p>\n\n## User Installation\n\n- Download AppFlowy Desktop for macOS, Windows, and Linux from GitHub Releases.\n- Mobile apps are available for iPhone and Android.\n- Self-hosting and source-build guides are linked from the official documentation.\n\n## Built With\n\n- Flutter\n- Rust",
